          "text": "post_2026_cba_arbitration_rules",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/0/claim/48",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/0",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "measured_win_probability_value_of_marginal_postseason_slot",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/0/claim/49",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/0",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Build a single pre-registered, dated-snapshot backtest harness for the offseason decisions (non-tender, QO, arbitration, posting). It would freeze public inputs as of each decision date, score each simple club baseline against a candidate model out of sample, and report n and interval width, so any candidate whose interval includes zero edge is dropped before software is built.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/0/claim/50",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/0",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Replace the coaching-ledger build with a persistence-first test: check on public data whether apparent coach effects in year T repeat in T+1 for coaches who moved clubs. Proceed to a hiring tool only if they persist beyond regression to the mean, and treat a null result as the useful output.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/0/claim/51",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/0",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Sharpen arbitration to settle-versus-hearing selection: estimate, from public filed-number gaps and past outcomes, the filing-gap threshold above which hearings favor the club. State the result as a decision table with explicit uncertainty rather than a point predictor.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        }
