      "authority": {
        "type": "ADVISORY",
        "executable": false
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/1",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Replace the six-candidate portfolio with one narrow, falsifiable pilot: a dated-snapshot backtest of tender/non-tender and qualifying-offer decisions pooled league-wide, scored against the \"projected WAR per dollar vs club threshold\" and \"offer if market AAV clearly exceeds QO\" baselines, with every input timestamped to the decision date.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/2",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The supplied evidence contains no facts, so every size, count, and rate below is unverified; no statistic is asserted here.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/3",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "cubs_private_models_and_practices",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/4",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "supplied_evidence_for_any_claim",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/5",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Candidate 1, coaching-hire evaluation. Keep only as a null-result study, not a decision tool: a coach-movement panel with matched non-moving controls and a pre-registered test of year-over-year persistence of coach effects.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/6",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Recurrence is real but small (a handful of hires per offseason), and the value per hire is unknown; \"large and recurring\" is a hypothesis, not evidence.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/7",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Staff tenure records (assistant and minor-league roles) are incomplete or inconsistently dated, which makes the linkage to players the weakest point.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/8",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Confounds include selection (clubs hire coaches after improvements), regression to the mean, roster turnover, playing time, park, injury, and organizational infrastructure; a coach touching few players gives wide intervals.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/9",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Outcomes are observable only with a lag and with heavy noise; a hindsight-free test must build ratings on seasons up to T and predict T+1 against a reputation proxy.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/10",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Clubs likely already run private attribution, and public sources (Statcast leaderboards, media reporting) give partial versions.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/11",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "It will look useful through anecdotal success stories and in-sample rankings that vanish out of sample.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/12",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "detectable_coach_effect_size",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/13",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "public_coach_tenure_dataset_completeness",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/14",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Candidate 2, non-tender decisions. This is the strongest candidate: it recurs every year, the decision date is fixed, and tender decisions, projected salaries, and later signings are public, so a pooled backtest across all clubs is possible.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/15",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Value per club is plausibly material only for a few borderline players a year; the number of those is unknown.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/16",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Projected arbitration salaries are public only as third-party estimates, whose vintage as of the deadline must be preserved to avoid hindsight.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/17",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The outcome is only partially observable: you see what non-tendered players did elsewhere, but not what the tendered player would have done, so the counterfactual is asymmetric.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/18",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Clubs already apply cost-per-WAR thresholds and public projections (e.g., projection systems, public salary estimators), so the edge over the baseline may be zero.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/19",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Replacement-market forecasting depends on who is available only after the deadline, so the forecast may be no better than a generic replacement-level price.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/20",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "It will look useful by showing that non-tendered players sometimes produce well; that is survivorship, and the correct test compares against tendered peers at equal price.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/21",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "historical_nontender_signing_outcomes_dataset",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/22",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Candidate 3, qualifying offers. Treat as a small-n calibration exercise embedded in the tender pilot, not a standalone product.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/23",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The decision applies to only a few players in a given year and only when the club has eligible free agents, and the number of historical acceptances is small, so calibration is weak.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/24",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Compensation value depends on CBA terms, which must be verified, and which may change at the next agreement.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/25",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Acceptance depends on player preference and the market, which are not public at the decision time.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/26",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Experienced executives and agents already use \"market AAV vs QO\" heuristics, and acceptance has historically been rare, so a rule of \"offer when market exceeds the QO\" is difficult to beat.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/27",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "It will look useful through a high accuracy score driven by the base rate of declined offers.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/28",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "current_qo_amount_2026",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/29",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "historical_qo_acceptance_count_by_year",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/30",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "cubs_qo_eligible_players_2026",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/31",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Candidate 4, NPB/KBO posting bids. Use as a Bayesian translation with wide intervals, reporting where the model cannot separate itself from simple ratios plus scouting.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/32",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Events are rare (a few relevant players per winter), so the value per signing may be large, but the annual aggregate for one club is small.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/33",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Calibration cases are few, and the league environments (ball, rules, park) change, so out-of-sample error likely dominates.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/34",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Pitch-tracking from foreign leagues is partially public at best, and scouting video is private to clubs.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/35",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Prices come from competitive bidding and posting rules, so a more accurate forecast must still overcome the winner's curse and the cap/fee structure.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/36",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The outcome is observable (MLB production), but only for those who were posted and signed, which creates selection bias.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/37",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "It will look useful by fitting a handful of famous players well.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/38",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "count_of_posted_players_with_mlb_outcomes",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/39",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "public_availability_of_npb_kbo_pitch_tracking",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/40",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Candidate 5, postseason roster construction. Reframe as a one-time sensitivity analysis to bound the value of the 25th and 26th roster slots, and build nothing until that bound exceeds measurement noise.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/41",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The decision recurs only when the club qualifies (zero to four times a year), so expected value per year is discounted by qualification probability.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/42",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Marginal slots may see little playing time, and series-win-probability differences are likely small relative to noise.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/43",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "A retrospective test has few rounds per club and relies on league-wide pooling, which removes health and context; counterfactual rosters are not observed.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/44",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Postseason rosters and transaction logs are public, but injury status at the deadline may not be.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/45",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Sophisticated clubs already simulate this privately, and public playoff-odds tools cover the seeding part.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/46",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "It will look useful through vivid after-the-fact stories (a pinch runner who scored), which reflect hindsight.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/47",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "measured_win_probability_value_of_marginal_postseason_slot",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/48",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "public_postseason_roster_archive_completeness",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/49",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Candidate 6, arbitration filing. Restrict to a settle-vs-hearing expected-value calculator built on public hearing results, and report the sample size before any modeling.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/50",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The decision recurs every January across the eligible roster, so volume is the highest of the six, but contested hearings are few league-wide each year and typically few or none for one club.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/51",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Many clubs follow a file-and-trial policy that is itself known to agents, so the strategy is a policy choice, not a prediction problem.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/52",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Panels decide on a restricted set of criteria and comparables, so the filing midpoint plus comparables are strong baselines; the public record of the arguments and the outcomes may be too thin to beat them.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
