          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Blind spot analysis across the set: add a shared evaluation protocol, with decision-date snapshots, a pooled league-wide test, a pre-registered simple baseline, and a reported minimum detectable effect, before any build decision.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/59",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Blind spot 1 is that five of six candidates are rare, small-n decisions, so none is likely to show a statistically detectable edge in a retrospective test.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/60",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Blind spot 2 is that the club-specific value is dominated by private information (medical, makeup, player preference, negotiation positions) that public data cannot capture.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/61",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Blind spot 3 is that the CBA expiration and rule changes may invalidate the historical records; the dates and the terms are unverified.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/62",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Blind spot 4 is that all six are one-off decisions, and the evidence suggests that recurring, high-volume, in-season decisions were not weighed at equal depth.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3/claim/63",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Blind spot 5 is that the candidate assumptions are pooled from a larger batch, so many (draft, ticketing, rain delays) do not apply, and counting them as evidence would inflate the criticism.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
