    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/0/claim/45",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "detectable_coach_effect_size",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/0/claim/46",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "win_probability_value_of_marginal_postseason_roster_slot",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/0/claim/47",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Sharpened replacement: run a pre-registered \"baseline-versus-model\" harness in which, for each candidate, the decision-time snapshot, the club's simple rule, a minimum detectable effect and the number of available historical cases are fixed before any model fitting. Build software only for decisions that pass (likely the non-tender and tender workflow, using frozen public projections and arbitration estimates as inputs), and treat coaching attribution as a research test whose null result would be informative.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/1",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Coaching hire evaluation (sharpened) - build a public coach-movement ledger, but use it first as a falsification study across all 30 clubs to test whether coach-attributed player change persists year over year, and only then as a hiring screen, with a pre-registered kill criterion.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/2",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Coaching hires recur yearly, but a club fills only a handful of major-league and upper-minors slots, so the per-club decision count is small even if league-wide history is larger.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/3",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Public staff announcements and media guides may be incomplete or misdated for assistant and minor-league roles, so coach-to-player linkage may be wrong.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/4",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Coach effects are confounded by roster turnover, playing time, selection of players a club expects to improve, organizational infrastructure, and regression to the mean, so unidentifiable effects are a live possibility.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/5",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Most coaches touch few movers, so intervals may be too wide to change a hiring decision; the test is whether year-T ratings predict year T+1 better than a reputation proxy such as prior big-league tenure.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/6",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "The outcome is observable (player metrics) but the counterfactual is not, so the test is predictive, not causal.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/7",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "public_coaching_staff_history_dataset",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/8",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "detectable_coach_effect_size",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/9",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "whether_rival_clubs_use_coach_attribution_models",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/10",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Non-tender decisions (sharpened) - rather than a forecaster of the whole replacement market, backtest only the marginal tender/non-tender call for borderline players, using projected arbitration salary (public estimates available before the deadline) against what comparable non-tendered players actually signed for and produced afterward.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/11",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "The decision recurs every late November and the number of borderline players per club is small, so value per year is likely modest and unquantified here.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/12",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Projected arbitration salaries, non-tender lists and signings are public, but the replacement market is only partly known at the deadline since non-tendered players are revealed at the deadline itself; using the later list is hindsight.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/13",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Historical non-tender cases number in the dozens per year league-wide, so a retrospective test is feasible, and next-season output is observable, though survivorship bias (only those who signed have outcomes) and injury noise distort it.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/14",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Clubs likely already apply a WAR-per-dollar threshold and private projections, so a public model may merely reproduce the baseline; it would look useful if backtested using the full list known after the deadline.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/15",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "historical_nontender_signing_outcomes_dataset",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/16",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "The pool is near the low-attention minor-league free-agent pool that a prior experiment found yielded under one contributor per club per year, so a ceiling of similar size is plausible.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/17",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Qualifying offers (sharpened) - treat as a small pooled-league calibration exercise, valuing the offer decision with an explicit acceptance probability and the draft-pick value under current rules, rather than a Cubs-specific model.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/18",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "The decision recurs only when the club has an eligible departing free agent, so expected annual value is discounted by how many such players exist.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/19",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Public QO history has only a handful of cases per year and acceptance has been rare, so a model may not beat a simple \"offer if market AAV clearly exceeds the QO\" rule.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/20",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Pick compensation value depends on revenue-sharing and tax status and on current CBA terms, which must be verified; a CBA transition could change or end the system.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/21",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Agent and player preferences, which are private, dominate acceptance, and the counterfactual of the player being offered or not is unobservable for non-offered players.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/22",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Backtests would look good if the market AAV used was the post-signing actual value rather than a forecast at decision time.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/23",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "cubs_qo_eligible_players_2026",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1/claim/24",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212457-b02b8f798c1e/baseline/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "current_qo_amount_2026",
